STATEMENT: >>>
212 of 865 internal links dangle, 25 percent. 49 of 90 distinct targets resolve
to nothing. The split is 123 references across 9 dropped sections, 80 references
to register-row anchors that markdown cannot address below file granularity, and
9 to symbol anchors. One provenance row cites a dropped section in the very row
recording that it was dropped.
